**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/test/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/acceptance/AcceptanceTest.java`** — the only `fiscalYear` reference in the repo. The class comment states the intended change ("Move date-derived values to a fiscal-year basis, where the fiscal year starts on 1 July"), and the test asserts a `fiscalYear` field matching `FY\d{2}` that does not yet exist in the main source:
```java
